OL,5,G1900 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,6,     FBen meets a family undertaking an
OL,7,     Fambitious renovation of a
OL,8,     Fdilapidated farmhouse in a
OL,9,     FBulgarian village, and discovers
OL,10,     Fhow crucial this fresh start is
OL,11,     Ffor them.
OL,12,G2000 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,13,     FBen heads into the forests of
OL,14,     Fnorthern New South Wales to meet
OL,15,     FJimmy, and learns he's faced
OL,16,     Fmultiple tragedies, including
OL,17,     Fbereavement and natural disasters.
